sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Pengguna
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant SS as Secure Storage

    U->>App: Masukkan email & password lalu tap Login
    App->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>API: Data user

    alt Kredensial valid dan akun terverifikasi
        API->>API: Generate JWT access_token + refresh_token
        API-->>App: 200 OK dengan token dan role
        App->>SS: Simpan token dan user_role
        App-->>U: Redirect ke halaman home sesuai role
    else Email atau password salah
        API-->>App: 401 Unauthorized
        App-->>U: Tampilkan pesan error
    else Akun belum diverifikasi
        API-->>App: 403 Forbidden
        App-->>U: Tampilkan pesan cek email
    end
